message: "Please cite the preferred manuscript citation and the exact repository revision used."
title: "Pressure-Driven Invariant Synthesis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Voss"
    given-names: "Logan"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-23
abstract: >-
  A reproducible implementation of collision-guided, append-only observable
  synthesis for dynamic representations, with conditional finite-sample
  theorems, internally frozen synthetic audits, full-pipeline label-null
  diagnostics, and mixed or null real-domain transfer results. The release
  includes an explicitly post-hoc Kuramoto coherence diagnostic, and makes no
  prospective-registration, universal-order, or population-injectivity claim.
keywords:
  - invariant synthesis
  - representation learning
  - observability
  - dynamical systems
  - recurrence networks
  - persistent homology
  - counterexample-guided synthesis
